{"id":"ee92d67ceb6220d0","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-tarski-undefinability.md","title":"Tarski Undefinability Property","display":"df-tarski-undefinability — Tarski Undefinability Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-tarski-undefinability","aliases":["90-df-tarski-undefinability"],"display":"df-tarski-undefinability — Tarski Undefinability Property","depends_on":["[[90-df-truth-definition]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","[[90-df-godel-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-tarski-undefinability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-tarski-undefinability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tarski-undefinability — Tarski Undefinability Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f63672a7ac0e50d2\" href=\"?note=f63672a7ac0e50d2\" title=\"90-df-truth-definition\">90-df-truth-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{arith}},\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{arith}},\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> 直接取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a>；存在固定解码器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S_{\\mathrm{arith}})}(g,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S_{\\mathrm{arith}})}(g,d)\\)</span>。本次调用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f63672a7ac0e50d2\" href=\"?note=f63672a7ac0e50d2\" title=\"90-df-truth-definition\">90-df-truth-definition</a> 的环境语言就是对象语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^*=S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S^*=S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> (arithmetic signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}=\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}=\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> (standard structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S_{\\mathrm{arith}})\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S_{\\mathrm{arith}})\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (fixed syntax encoding)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruthDef}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}},\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}\">\\(\\mathrm{TruthDef}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}},\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}\\)</span> (internal truth-definition predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f63672a7ac0e50d2\" href=\"?note=f63672a7ac0e50d2\" title=\"90-df-truth-definition\">90-df-truth-definition</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TarskiUndef}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}\">\\(\\mathrm{TarskiUndef}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}\\)</span> (undefinability predicate, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tarski\\text{-}undefinability}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{TarskiUndef}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}(\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists\\tau(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^{(1)}\\;\n\\mathrm{TruthDef}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}},\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}(\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tarski\\text{-}undefinability}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{TarskiUndef}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}(\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists\\tau(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^{(1)}\\;\n\\mathrm{TruthDef}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}},\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}(\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件只定义“同一算术语言中没有公式定义标准模型全部真句编码”这一性质；其成立性由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"7e636ff8dc7682de\" href=\"?note=7e636ff8dc7682de\" title=\"90-thm-tarski-undefinability\">90-thm-tarski-undefinability</a> 在显式对角化与可靠性条件下证明。</li>\n<li>外部元语言仍可定义或谈论算术真值。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-truth-definition","status":"resolved","id":"f63672a7ac0e50d2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-truth-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-